; An unpriced entry in two commodities of opposite sign is an exchange.
2024-01-01 Change money
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD

; The cost lands on the commodity written first, whichever side that is.
2024-01-02 Change money back
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR

; Several postings in the first commodity take a per-unit cost.
2024-01-03 Split purchase
    Assets:Euros       60 EUR
    Assets:Travel      40 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD

2024-01-04 Purchase with a refund
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Travel     -10 EUR
    Assets:Dollars    -99 USD

; A fee in the second commodity is netted before the cost is inferred.
2024-01-05 Buy shares
    Assets:Brokerage   10 AAPL
    Expenses:Fees       5 USD
    Assets:Dollars  -1505 USD

; An elided posting takes both remainders and nothing is inferred.
2024-01-06 Opening
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD
    Equity:Opening

; Priced postings that cancel leave the exchange standing.
2024-01-07 Wash and exchange
    Assets:Brokerage   10 AAPL @ 150 USD
    Assets:Custody    -10 AAPL @ 150 USD
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD

; A commodity that nets to zero is not one of the two.
2024-01-08 Pounds in and out
    Assets:Pounds       5 GBP
    Assets:Sterling    -5 GBP
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD

; Bracketed postings are an exchange of their own.
2024-01-09 Envelopes
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD
    [Budget:Euros]      5 EUR
    [Budget:Dollars]   -6 USD
